== Usage ==

[[File:Glamered Weapon Aura comparison.jpg|thumb|right|420px|Glamered Weapon Aura comparison]]

[[File:Weapon Aura UI.png‎|thumb|right|200px|Weapon Aura UI]]

Use this glamer on any cosmetic weapon (except bows and crossbows, shields and orbs, rune arms, or hand wraps) that has been created through a [[Mirror of Glamering]] to change the weapon's visual effect.

Glamered Auras can be used on thrown weapons, but the effect is not noticeable on Shuriken. Effects are not maintained after the weapon leaves your hand. You will not be able to craft if you have a stack of weapon auras or they are locked in your inventory. 

Glamered Weapon Auras cannot be placed on ready-made weapon cosmetics, such as the {{Item|Legendary Sword of Shadow}}. Named Glamer Auras can be used more than once.

